{"id":"sorcie_re","lemma":"sorcière","pos":"noun","rank":1567,"glosses":["witch, sorceress"],"ipa":"/sɔʁ.sjɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b5/Fr-sorci%C3%A8re.ogg/Fr-sorci%C3%A8re.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sorcières","masculine":"sorcier"},"formAudio":{"sorcières":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/26/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-sorci%C3%A8res.wav","sorcier":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-sorcier.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Es-tu une sorcière ?","en":"Are you a wizard?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"La chasse aux sorcières a commencé.","en":"The witch hunt has begun.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"hunt, hunting"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to begin, commence","l":"commencer"}]},{"text":"Je ne suis pas une sorcière.","en":"I'm not a witch.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Je pense qu'elle est une sorcière.","en":"I think she's a witch.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"On pensait que cette femme étrange était une sorcière.","en":"The strange-looking woman was thought to be a witch.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"woman"},{"g":"strange"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}